        "title": "The chart below gives information about car ownership in the UK from 1975 to 2005. Summarize the information by selecting and reporting the main features, and make comparisons where relevant.",
        "status": "published",
        "content_writing": "<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IL3YdQ9taomv7RxUnrtlXx6rg0b\"><strong>The chart below gives information about car ownership in the UK from 1975 to 2005. Summarize the information by selecting and reporting the main features, and make comparisons where relevant.</strong></div>\n</div>",
        "order": 1,
        "instruction": "<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>IELTS Writing Task 1 - Car Ownership in the UK: 1975&ndash;2005</em></p>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQlGdpAaUoJFOsxWOYzlDAiUgDe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1.</strong><strong> </strong><strong>Giải th&iacute;ch đề</strong></span></h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N0nNdqrxtoU9EGxkGvml6QHzgzd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GWPNd7ft0oPRpuxfDGnl1aKWgoe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N64jd9FvgoRfDTx2p91lBNjJgRc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TqPldEHP5oO9Eqxr2kRlefpxgtb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XqItdByFCopoQfxNSMplwkrkgrb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/task-1-line-charts\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">Giới thiệu dạng Line Graphs</a></strong></span></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XqItdByFCopoQfxNSMplwkrkgrb\" data-list=\"bullet\">Đề b&agrave;i Car Ownership in the UK: 1975&ndash;2005 y&ecirc;u cầu m&ocirc; tả về việc sở hữu &ocirc; t&ocirc; tại Vương quốc Anh từ năm 1975 đến năm 2005.</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KJIDd23oMoldbUxAfnilBuFRgNd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Bạn n&ecirc;n học c&aacute;ch <span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/so-lieu-tuong-doi\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">tả số liệu 'tương đối' &amp; paraphrase cấu tr&uacute;c c&acirc;u</a></strong></span> trước khi viết b&agrave;i &rarr;<strong>&nbsp;</strong>đ&acirc;y l&agrave; kỹ năng viết v&ocirc; c&ugrave;ng quan trọng để d&ugrave;ng trong cả b&agrave;i viết.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GWPNd7ft0oPRpuxfDGnl1aKWgoe\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTLqda2f9ooxOTxsgKLlEoHXgHc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Introduction</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DQntd3hjzoNCjwxOfz4lvHOcgbb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N9LhdhEVXoJnGNxJPvyl0YZPg9e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CRT6dLvfRoVbHtxCnc9l7AdygTl\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-V2KUdr10HoS97zxVv0ilC6U1g9d\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Nội dung:</strong> Paraphrase đề Car Ownership in the UK: 1975&ndash;2005 với c&aacute;c dữ kiện ch&iacute;nh l&agrave;: số người sở hữu &ocirc; t&ocirc; - Great Britain - 1975 đến 2005.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OgsFdG0GQo8ftax8IAZlfh0Gguh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Học c&aacute;ch viết Introduction</strong> cho <strong>tất cả</strong> c&aacute;c b&agrave;i dạng <strong>Line Graphs</strong> ở đ&acirc;y bạn nh&eacute; &rarr;<strong>&nbsp;</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/intro-line\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">C&aacute;ch viết Introduction dạng LINE</a></strong></span></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Overview</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WTQ0dwsgtot3Mux4ZXOl05hSgTH\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AmqcddMWAotWQFxJT6xl8CElghf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RKcrd7u17ogCsex6cUPlJ2cCgkh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JLrudDKQVoB78vxXmgzldmNBgLh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"BZPkdsfKwoq7BzxyxnxlkJX9gMU\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RVYLdoOreonWNxx8ViwlHLpZgac\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, với dạng đề thay đổi theo thời gian, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ đề cập đến 2 th&ocirc;ng tin ch&iacute;nh:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QIQkdEYigobJfLx8Z2CljeKhgRf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Trends: </strong>việc sở hữu &ocirc; t&ocirc; ở Anh tăng trong khoảng thời gian 30 năm.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PcwvdvStHoWWSGxAWq7lEs06gSg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Differences: </strong>việc sở hữu một chiếc &ocirc; t&ocirc; lu&ocirc;n l&agrave; sự lựa chọn phổ biến nhất.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZrvgdhtrQovJnNxqKVSl5FLhgxe\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4.</strong><strong> Ph&acirc;n Body r&otilde; r&agrave;ng</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P98ZdcS4KoF2cIxRdnYl02e4gre\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FVyzdmf9noY8HEx1DxAl475ZgPh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZRV0dgAnjoXiRVxRxmol5UwwgBb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ chia đoạn th&acirc;n b&agrave;i một c&aacute;ch r&otilde; r&agrave;ng, bằng c&aacute;ch gom c&aacute;c hạng mục c&oacute; sự tương đồng, cụ thể như sau:</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CpWhdSGJFoye2PxbbFelCRADg5e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"BZPkdsfKwoq7BzxyxnxlkJX9gMU\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MtVPdI6DOoCUxWxXH3ylaYpFgPe\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Body 1:</strong><strong> Nh&oacute;m người sở hữu 1 car v&agrave; no car</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KNkndw5OSocmq1xWSDmlwe0IgJw\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở Body 1 như sau:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RWSSdSvYkoh0zWxF87El5bw1gpe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 1) <strong>So s&aacute;nh số liệu năm 1975 </strong><em>(nh&oacute;m người sở hữu 1 car l&agrave; 45% v&agrave; no car l&agrave; 20%)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PyjrdDDF6oFln1xpgVglgpI5g9g\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 2) <strong>M&ocirc; tả</strong> <strong>xu hướng của nh&oacute;m người sở hữu 1 car </strong><em>(giảm trong 10 năm đầu, sau đ&oacute; tăng đến 45% v&agrave;o năm 2005)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FSfOdYDOyoYszjxz0qslKduVg5g\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 3) <strong>M&ocirc; tả</strong> <strong>xu hướng của nh&oacute;m người sở hữu no car </strong> <em>(giảm xuống 25% v&agrave;o năm 1985, sau đ&oacute; tiếp tục giảm từ từ xuống 21% v&agrave;o năm 2005)</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EwzTddSWRoqDSGxM4hFlvPg1grc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"BZPkdsfKwoq7BzxyxnxlkJX9gMU\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JrmqdBejro2aG4x8YgXldCyzgLh\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Body 2</strong><strong>: Nh&oacute;m người sở hữu 2 cars v&agrave; 3 cars</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J7kWdGFuho2SOTx6rTklNgmrg2c\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở Body 2 như sau:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LpkldGaI0on8dWxJnc8lg0Ongef\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 1) <strong>So s&aacute;nh số liệu năm 1975 </strong><em>(nh&oacute;m người sở hữu 2 cars l&agrave; 6% v&agrave; 3 cars l&agrave; 2%)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WOiAdrtajoXmatx15WZlnyu3gDd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 2) <strong>M&ocirc; tả</strong> <strong>xu hướng của nh&oacute;m người sở hữu 2 cars </strong><em>(</em><em><strong>tăng từ từ </strong></em><em>đến 18% v&agrave;o năm 2005)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VO7xd5wsKohT0kxKqDbloA7cgDh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 3) <strong>M&ocirc; tả</strong> <strong>xu hướng của nh&oacute;m người sở hữu 3 cars </strong> <em>(</em><em><strong>tăng từ từ</strong></em><em> đến 10% v&agrave;o năm 2005)</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TOGCdDfzMo4b0vxNcTDlMZwkgW6\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>5.</strong><strong> Gợi &yacute; Paraphrasing</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E8TVdaTROorfxXxMBfGldJ6pgbd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FASwd2UiCoitfbxeuYllUMqJg2b\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Bc2gdrij0o2chcxcadllSjTsgke\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XdYcdsZ6Uo6tuXxGPs3lNnJUgHh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HE29dhmJjod0qix8V1qlgw9gggc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"BZPkdsfKwoq7BzxyxnxlkJX9gMU\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Fz70du0x3ojhGpx1466lKVdfgDe\">Khi muốn diễn đạt <strong>\"sở hữu một chiếc xe hơi\"</strong>, thay v&igrave; d&ugrave;ng <strong>\"possess a car\"</strong> th&igrave; m&igrave;nh c&oacute; thể paraphrase với cụm danh từ <strong>\"single-car possession\" </strong>để đa dạng cấu tr&uacute;c c&acirc;u của m&igrave;nh hơn nh&eacute;.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Rh6AdQHAUop3qBxubB2lzLqtgmf\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JXiidMLk8oNkjqx21cnlCGApgEe\"><strong>V&iacute; dụ:</strong></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HPLZdpSrEoQZDMxSkyCl3MOzghf\">The percentage of <strong>single-car possession</strong> followed an upward trend, finally ending up at 45% in 2005.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E8TVdaTROorfxXxMBfGldJ6pgbd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FASwd2UiCoitfbxeuYllUMqJg2b\">\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
